OL,3,GNEWSACharities warn of bonfire danger
OL,4,Afor hedgehogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FWildlife charities have asked people to
OL,7,Fconsider hedgehogs before disposing of
OL,8,Fany debris from Storm Austen in
OL,9,Fbonfires.
OL,11,FAnimal welfare groups in both Guernsey
OL,12,Fand Jersey said more people may be
OL,13,Fplanning to have bonfires after the
OL,14,Fstorm brought down trees and branches.
OL,15,FIt comes as hedgehogs numbers have
OL,16,Fplummeted in the Channel Islands as the
OL,17,Fanimals struggle to survive in hot
OL,18,Fsummers.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
