OL,3,GNEWSACharities warn of bonfire danger
OL,4,Afor hedgehogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey Hedgehog Preservation Group
OL,7,Fadvised people to build a bonfire on
OL,8,Fthe day and not several days in advance
OL,9,Fas it "only takes one night for a
OL,10,Fhedgehog to move in".
OL,12,FSteve Byrne from the GSPCA in Guernsey
OL,13,Fadvised people to check their bonfire
OL,14,Fcarefully before setting light to it.
